# The source distribution carries dw3d's test suite whole: the tests, their conftest and reference
# data, and the benchmark package several of them import. The 3-D example images (data/Images) and the
# benchmarking dataset are not shipped: the tests that need them skip. dw2d's suite (tests/two_dimensional) and its
# masks ship in delaunay-watershed-2d's source distribution (distributions/delaunay-watershed-2d). The changelog and
# the release notes are shipped too: they are user documentation, and a test checks what they quote.
include CHANGELOG.md RELEASE_NOTES.md
graft tests
graft dw3d_benchmarks
prune tests/two_dimensional
global-exclude __pycache__/* *.py[cod] .DS_Store
